# NOTE: this file is written and must be read via nitransforms
# (nitransforms.linear.load(path, fmt='fs').matrix), not FreeSurfer's own LTA
# tools -- nitransforms stores LTAs using FreeSurfer's "points convention",
# so the raw matrix numbers above are NOT the intended physical transform
# directly; only round-tripping through nitransforms' reader/writer gives
# back the correct matrix.
# Maps HiP-CT brain native physical space (mm, corner-origin: voxel (0,0,0) -> RAS
# (0,0,0), any pyramid level) to true MNI RAS.
# CORRECTED 2026-08-31 (third pass): extracted directly from the real NIfTI
# sform headers of 494.08um_EBB.nii.gz (source, raw/untransformed -- its own
# sform is exactly the corner-origin diag(0.49408mm) convention used
# elsewhere as native_affine(6), so no further conversion is needed to make
# this level-agnostic) and
# reg_EBB_to_EBBMRI_in_MNI/494.08um_EBB.prealigned-mni.moved.nii.gz (target,
# nominally in the same MNI-registered frame as the approved
# reg_EBBMRI_to_MNI/0.5mm_EBB-MRI.moved.nii.gz). Matrix = dst.affine @
